        "DashboardBody": {
          "Fn::Join": [
            "",
            [
              "{"periodOverride":"auto","widgets":[{"type":"text","width":24,"height":5,"x":0,"y":0,"properties":{"markdown":"# 🎮 Gaming Gateway - 3-Way Architecture Comparison\\n## NGINX (EC2) vs CloudFront+ALB+Lambda vs CloudFront+API Gateway+Lambda\\n---\\n| Path | Route | Backend | Cost Model |\\n|------|-------|---------|------------|\\n| \`/nginx/*\` | CloudFront → NGINX ALB → EC2 ASG | NGINX | EC2 hourly |\\n| \`/lambda/*\` | CloudFront → Lambda ALB → Lambda | Lambda Cells | Pay-per-request |\\n| \`/apigw/*\` | CloudFront → API Gateway → Lambda | API GW + Lambda | $1/M req + Lambda |\\n\\n> Send identical traffic to each path for fair comparison."}},{"type":"text","width":24,"height":1,"x":0,"y":5,"properties":{"markdown":"## ⏱️ Latency Comparison"}},{"type":"metric","width":12,"height":6,"x":0,"y":6,"properties":{"view":"timeSeries","title":"Response Time - Average (ms)","region":"",
